# Test placement

Put tests in a **`__tests__`** directory beside the code under test.

- **Example**: `path/to/module.ts` → `path/to/__tests__/module.test.ts`.
- **Features**: `path/to/feature/foo.ts` → `path/to/feature/__tests__/foo.test.ts` (one `__tests__` per logical folder is fine).
- Avoid a single dump of all tests at repo root unless the project already standardizes on that (this one does not).

Use the repo’s test runner; name files `*.test.ts` or `*.spec.ts` to match existing tests.
